type: software
title: "k11 API Contract QA MCP Server"
abstract: "MCP server and Claude Code plugin for API contract testing across OpenAPI, Swagger, GraphQL, gRPC, AsyncAPI and SOAP: finds breaking changes before merge and which consumers they break, down to the fields each one reads or sends, checks deployed services for drift, generates contract tests and posts a verdict on pull requests."
